    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, I mean, creating a business now, there's red tape, there's regulation, there's taxes, there's so much BS you have to worry about, it's turning a lot of us off to wanting to do anything like that. And our dad was a small business owner, he was a car salesman. you know, you own wood shops, he was a car salesman, he was a contractor. You could kind of do all that stuff more, you know, back in the day. And for our generation now, there's not a lot of incentive.",
